Package: lglasso
Type: Package
Title:  Graphical Lasso for Longitudinal data
Version: 2.0.0
Description: This package estimates the precision matrices and the corresponding
    temporal correlation parameters for longitudinal high-dimensional normal data.
    It is motivated by the analysis of omics data in clinical trials where the 
    longitudinal omics data are becoming increasingly common. It can handle 
    both one-stage models (without treatment/exposure) and two-stage models (with one 
    treatment/exposure). For details of the algorithms, please check the materials 
    on its GitHub repo. If you have any questions, feel free to contact the maintainers 
    through the email below.
